import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 872 | Transcended Ones and Society | The Transcended One's Promotion of Social Mobility","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 872 | Transcended Ones and Society | The Transcended One's Promotion of Social Mobility","no":872,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Social Mobility","Class Mobility","Every Rank Has a Path","Anti-Solidification"],"related":["36-Social Structure and Class Mobility","08-Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System","17-Plane-Sovereign-Strong-One Standard","870-Transcended One's Relationship with Mid-Level Cultivators"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0872_模块4-超脱者与社会-社会流动促进.md","filePath":"en/0872_模块4-超脱者与社会-社会流动促进.md"}`),a={name:"en/0872_模块4-超脱者与社会-社会流动促进.md"};function l(s,e,r,h,d,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-872-transcended-ones-and-society-the-transcended-one-s-promotion-of-social-mobility" tabindex="-1">Entry 872 | Transcended Ones and Society | The Transcended One&#39;s Promotion of Social Mobility <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-872-transcended-ones-and-society-the-transcended-one-s-promotion-of-social-mobility" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 872 | Transcended Ones and Society | The Transcended One&#39;s Promotion of Social Mobility&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 36, 08, 17, 870</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-transcended-one-may-not-be-both-athlete-and-referee-—-his-job-is-to-smooth-the-track" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the transcended one may not be both athlete and referee — his job is to smooth the track <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-transcended-one-may-not-be-both-athlete-and-referee-—-his-job-is-to-smooth-the-track" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the transcended one may not be both athlete and referee — his job is to smooth the track&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s social mobility is a joke: nominally &quot;are kings and lords born of a special seed?&quot;; in reality each era&#39;s tower top is monopolized by a few great sects and great families. Bottom-level cultivators risk their lives climbing halfway up, the ceiling above does not move a bit. Heng Yuan Zhou must answer: <strong>as the highest-position existence, what role should the transcended one play in social mobility?</strong> The answer is: he does not block the road, does not set checkpoints, does not run circles — his job is to smooth the track, adjust the traffic lights, lift the ceiling. This entry explains how the transcended one promotes social mobility.</p><p>Six top-level axioms simultaneously take the stage: the anti-predation axiom forbids the transcended one using power to solidify class; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings possess equal mobility qualification; the collective ascension axiom requires mobility&#39;s direction be overall upward; the causal self-discipline axiom requires mobility-channel design and execution be traceable; the law-first axiom requires the mobility mechanism be law-level self-consistent, not manipulable by the transcended one personally; the universal equal infinite law confirms all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; easygoing layabouts retain a floor and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher infinity — infinite origin is inherent in all, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-how-the-old-world-s-class-solidification-formed" tabindex="-1">I. How the Old World&#39;s Class Solidification Formed <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-how-the-old-world-s-class-solidification-formed" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. How the Old World&#39;s Class Solidification Formed&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s class solidification is not because &quot;the bottom is incapable,&quot; but because three invisible walls:</p><ol><li><strong>Resource wall</strong>: the upper layer monopolizes spiritual veins, secret realms, manuals, and teachers; the bottom cannot get them;</li><li><strong>Identity wall</strong>: sect children and family heirs are naturally first; scattered cultivators and wild paths run into walls everywhere;</li><li><strong>Rule wall</strong>: the upper layer makes rules, rules naturally favor the rule-makers — competitions&#39; formats, secret-realm access, breakthrough certification, all decided by the upper layer.</li></ol><p>Three walls together, bottom-level cultivators however hard they try cannot climb up. This is why the old world periodically erupts &quot;defy heaven to change fate&quot;-style revolutions — not because the bottom is naturally rebellious, but because the walls are too thick.</p><h2 id="ii-the-transcended-one-s-four-actions-of-demolishing-walls" tabindex="-1">II. The Transcended One&#39;s Four Actions of Demolishing Walls <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-transcended-one-s-four-actions-of-demolishing-walls" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Transcended One&#39;s Four Actions of Demolishing Walls&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou requires the transcended one proactively demolish these three walls:</p><h3 id="demolish-the-resource-wall" tabindex="-1">Demolish the resource wall <a class="header-anchor" href="#demolish-the-resource-wall" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Demolish the resource wall&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>Push the cultivation-resource opening mechanism (Document 18) to execute, ensuring spiritual veins, secret realms, and manuals are public network-wide;</li><li>Create new resources through increment development, not zero-sum allocation within stock;</li><li>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision monitors whether resource allocation is fair; if resources concentrate in a small circle, automatically trigger review.</li></ul><h3 id="demolish-the-identity-wall" tabindex="-1">Demolish the identity wall <a class="header-anchor" href="#demolish-the-identity-wall" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Demolish the identity wall&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>Promotion review does not look at birth, lineage, or clan; only looks at cultivation results and post contributions;</li><li>Strange life, mixed-mutant clans, and undeveloped-plane native-civilization cultivators enjoy equal review standards;</li><li>Implicit channels like &quot;sect guaranteed entry&quot; and &quot;family special recruitment&quot; are prohibited.</li></ul><h3 id="demolish-the-rule-wall" tabindex="-1">Demolish the rule wall <a class="header-anchor" href="#demolish-the-rule-wall" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Demolish the rule wall&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>Rules are made by the Anchor Council; the transcended one has only one vote on the council (see entry 785);</li><li>Review standards are public network-wide through the Selfless Dao, accepting Myriad-Rank questioning;</li><li>Review process involves multi-party representatives; the transcended one may not decide autocratically.</li></ul><h3 id="lift-the-ceiling" tabindex="-1">Lift the ceiling <a class="header-anchor" href="#lift-the-ceiling" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Lift the ceiling&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li>The ceiling is not some person&#39;s height, but the whole civilization&#39;s height;</li><li>The transcended one&#39;s job is to continuously open new planes, new laws, new cultivation directions, letting the ceiling continuously rise;</li><li>Today&#39;s ceiling is tomorrow&#39;s floor — this is infinite iteration (see entry 898).</li></ul><h2 id="iii-social-mobility-s-health-indicators" tabindex="-1">III. Social Mobility&#39;s Health Indicators <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-social-mobility-s-health-indicators" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Social Mobility&#39;s Health Indicators&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou does not judge &quot;whether mobility is healthy&quot; by feeling, but uses a set of quantitative indicators:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Indicator</th><th>Meaning</th><th>Health Standard</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Upward-mobility rate</td><td>Among cultivators annually promoted to the next realm, the proportion from the bottom</td><td>≥40%</td></tr><tr><td>Downward-mobility rate</td><td>Among transcended ones / high-level cultivators failing post assessment and demoted</td><td>No lower limit; demote when deserved</td></tr><tr><td>Circle-penetration rate</td><td>Among high-level posts, the proportion holding cross-region, cross-lineage, cross-clan posts</td><td>≥30%</td></tr><tr><td>Resource dispersion</td><td>The proportion of public resources controlled by the top 10% of cultivators</td><td>≤30%</td></tr><tr><td>Newcomer share</td><td>Among cultivators newly entering high-level posts, the proportion without &quot;family/sect&quot; background</td><td>≥50%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These indicators are automatically tallied by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, periodically public to Myriad Ranks. When indicators are anomalous, the Anchor Supervisory Committee opens an investigation.</p><h2 id="iv-the-transcended-one-himself-is-also-mobile" tabindex="-1">IV. The Transcended One Himself Is Also Mobile <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-transcended-one-himself-is-also-mobile" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Transcended One Himself Is Also Mobile&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Promoting social mobility is not only &quot;help others move&quot; — the transcended one himself must also be mobile:</p><ul><li><strong>Post mobility</strong>: the transcended one is not lifetime; periodic rotation, cannot stay in one position too long forming interest groups;</li><li><strong>Energy mobility</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s energy flows to Myriad Ranks through Myriad-Rank origin bidirectional circulation (Documents 15, 25), not hoarded in his own body;</li><li><strong>Knowledge mobility</strong>: the transcended one&#39;s insights open network-wide through the Selfless Dao, not privately hoarded as sect secrets.</li></ul><p>The transcended one himself mobile, then has the right to require others to be mobile. If he himself holds a post and does not step down, he is new solidification.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: releasing talent blocked by the three walls is the greatest energy-level release</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: demolishing walls is cutting the predatory cycle of &quot;upper layer monopolizes resources — bottom has no road&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo grace system&#39;s ceiling is Gu Chensha&#39;s personal height, solidified to the top; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ceiling is infinitely iterable, the transcended one responsible for pushing it higher and higher</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: mobility indicators cover five Myriad-Rank lineages, not favoring any clan</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: mobility indicators, review standards, and promotion records all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s role in social mobility is not beneficiary, but road-builder. He does not block the road, set checkpoints, or run circles — he demolishes the resource wall, identity wall, and rule wall one by one, pushes the ceiling higher and higher, letting every Myriad-Rank being rise by his own effort. When social mobility no longer requires &quot;defying heaven to change fate,&quot; but happens naturally, civilization truly lives. This is the orthodox definition of the transcended one promoting social mobility.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/36-社会结构与阶层流动.html">Entry 36 · Social Structure and Class Mobility</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Every-Person-Has-a-Path Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign-Strong-One Standard</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/870_模块4-超脱者与社会-超脱者与中产修炼者的关系.html">Entry 870 · Transcended One&#39;s Relationship with Mid-Level Cultivators</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",l]]);export{m as __pageData,y as default};
